| Event Name | Frequency | Warning Indicator | Player Action Required |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Botnet DDoS Wave** | Every 5–8 mins | Network HUD spikes Red, Ping climbs | Activate Hardware Firewall, throttle untrusted IPs |
| **Citywide Grid Brownout** | Random / Storms | Lights flicker, Grid voltage drops to 0 | Turn on Backup Diesel Generators before batteries drain |
| **DeFi Yield Spike** | Every 10 mins | Golden ticker banner, 5x gas payout | Overclock racks to max compute for 60 seconds |
| **Coolant Pipe Leak** | Hardware wear | Puddle appears under liquid loop | Dispatch repair drone / fix pipe before short-circuit |
| **Cyber Police Node Audit** | Triggered by high power | Sirens outside, 30s timer | Enable encrypted zero-knowledge proxy router |

