## 8. Web3 & `icp-coresdk` Integration Architecture

### 8.1. On-Chain Features
* **Player State Canister:** Every player can save their facility layout, inventory, and achievements to their own authenticated subaccount.
* **Internet Identity Login:** 1-click biometric passkey authentication. No passwords or seed phrases.
* **Decentralized Leaderboard:** Real-time queries for highest Cycles/sec, longest uptime, and zero-downtime streaks.
* **Canister Blueprints:** Players can export efficient node blueprints as shareable URLs or collectible on-chain configs.

